*   **convenience_feature_score**: 0.20. Features like keyless entry/go, cruise control, light/rain sensors, and parking sensors are available (Source [1], [5], [8], [9], [11], [14], [16], [22]). It lacks some of the more advanced convenience features found in larger luxury vehicles (e.g., 360 cameras, remote park).
